          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu mwaka gwa 18 Yehoshafati omukama wa Yuda aliire engoma, Yehoramu eya Ahabu atwara Isiraeli ayemire Samaria. Akamara emyaka 12 aha ngoma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agokera Omukama n'orwo atagobire ahali ishe na nyina, aha rw'okuba akakambura enyomyo ya Baali eyo ishe yabaire ayombekire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai kandi akazigilira obufu bwa Yeroboamu eya Nebati obwo yafakaize Isiraeli; tiyabulekire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mesha omukama wa Moabu yagiraga entama. Buli mwaka yasholeraga omukama wa Isiraeli obutaama 1,000 n'obwoya bw'empaya z'entama 100,000. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "NAwe Ahabu kayafire omukama wa Moabu ashenga omukama wa Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikwo Omukama Yehoramu kuruga Samaria omu biro ebyo akahuruza Isiraeli yona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agenda atuma ahali Yehoshafati omukama wa Yuda ati, “Omukama wa Moabu anshengire; oije tumutabalire.” Ogu amugarukamu ati, “Ndagenda; iwe nanye tuli bamoi, abantu bange bawe, n'efarasi zange zawe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoshafati ashuba agamba ati, “Tutwarwe muhandaki?” Yehoramu amuhorora ati, “Tutwarwe omuhanda gw'Eirungu lya Edomu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho omukama wa Isiraeli, n'owa Yuda, n'owa Edomu batabara. Kabagenzire orugendo rw'akazingolekano orw'ebiro mushanju, eihe n'ebitunganwa ebyo babaire bainabyo, liburwa amaizi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho omukama wa Isiraeli agamba ati, “Yo, Omukama ayesire abakama aba bonshatu kubanaga omu mikono y'omukama wa Moabu!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoshafati abaza ati, “Kunu taliyo murangi wa Mukama akatubaliza tukamanya eky'Omukama agendeleire?” Aho omuramata w'omukama wa Isiraeli ahorora ati, “Haliho Elisha eya Shafati ayabaire ali musigire wa Eliya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoshafati ati, “Ogwo ekigambo ky'Omukama nakigamba.” Nikwo Yehoramu omukama wa Isiraeli na Yehoshafati n'Omukama wa Edomu kusongoka bagiire ahali Elisha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elisha agambira omukama wa Isiraeli ati, “Kazareki inye naiwe? Ogye aha barangi ba sho n'abarangi ba nyoko.” Kyonkai Yehoramu omukama wa Isiraeli amugambira ati, “Chei, Omukama niwe ayesire abakama aba bonshatu kubanaga omu mikono y'omukama wa Moabu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elisha ati, “Obuso bw'Omukama w'amahe owo nkolera, k'atakubaire Yehoshafati omukama wa Yuda, tinakukulebire anga kukunagira lisho; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kyonkai mbwenu mundetere omutezi w'enanga.” K'omutezi yateire enanga, Omukama Ruhanga atungama ahali Elisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elisha agamba ati, “Omukama Ruhanga nagamba ati, ‘ORuhanga oru orwomire ndarwijuza ebitunga.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngu, ‘Timulikwija kubona muyaga anga njura, kyonkai oRuhanga oru ruraijura amaizi, munywe, n'ente zanyu n'ebitunganwa byanyu ebindi.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha Mukama eki kigambo kijege, nangu n'Abamoabu naija kubabanaga omu mikono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli kigo ekiina eboma na buli kigo ekirungi murabikwata; buli muti gw'ebiraba muguteme, mushube mwigare enchuro zona, na buli itaka elina eitongo mulisangize amabare.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bukeire bwankya, kwija kugoba aha izoba lyobatambiragaho ebitambo, amaizi garuga elya Edomu, ensi yona elemwa eijura.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abamoabu kuhulira okwo abakama babatabalira, abashaija bona ababaire nibashobora kukwata ebikwato by'endashana, bahurura omuto n'omukuru, besimba omu rubibi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwankya karai nibaimuka, eizoba lyateire aha maizi, Abamoabu babona amaizi nigatukura nk'obwamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bagamba bati, “Obu bwamba, rwona abakama lirwaine baitangana. Mpaho inywe Bamoabu, tugende tukwate eminyago.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo bagobire orusisira rwa Isiraeli, Abaisiraeli baimuka batera Abamoabu. Abamoabu babairuka, kyonkai bagenda babahondeire babaita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebigo babikambura, aharungi hona mbali eitongo lyabaire lili bahasangiza amabare; enchuro zona baziigalira, emiti y'ebiraba yona bagitema. Ahanyuma hakasigarwaho ekigo kya Kirihareseti, kyonkai bakibunda n'ebihubezo bakiteza amabare bakisinga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo omukama wa Moabu yaboine okwo endashana yamugendera kubi, akwata abaisherukare 700 ab'embanda abone kurabamu ababisha kwirukira ow'omukama wa Edomu, kyonkai tibashoboire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho akwata omutabani omukuru ayabaire naija kumusikira, amutamba ekitambo ky'okwokibwa aha boma eiguru. Nirwo eihano lyaraliire Isiraeli, bakamurugaho bakashuba omu nsi yabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
